  "prompt": "Mailvora wants to see which activation events open a session. For each activation event on 14 October 2025 (the UTC day of event_ts, a UTC instant), show new_session: 1 when the event is the user's first event that day or comes more than 30 minutes after the user's previous event that day, and 0 otherwise. An event exactly 30 minutes after the one before is not a new session. Use only that day's events. When two events of a user share a moment, take them in event_name order, A to Z. Return four columns, in this order: user_id, event_ts, event_name and new_session. Return one row for each event. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "user_id",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "event_ts",
        "type_class": "temporal"
